                "word": "zabawnie",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9e73e11f-834d-3baf-ae1c-44387876836d",
                        "entry_id": "f6d3f9c6-03b3-3bac-aab3-3da722c24794",
                        "glosses": [
                            "w sposób zabawny"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "def00132-9027-42e8-b55e-902f3d9b640c",
                                "sense_id": "9e73e11f-834d-3baf-ae1c-44387876836d",
                                "text": "Nie wiem, który z nich wyglądał najzabawniej?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "773d7ce9-2d43-45c3-a275-62bc455b5fcb",
                                "sense_id": "9e73e11f-834d-3baf-ae1c-44387876836d",
                                "text": "Dosyć to wyglądało zabawnie, szokująco wręcz"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a5f396ed-5928-4c98-b33f-9302eefdc00e",
                        "source_entry_id": "f6d3f9c6-03b3-3bac-aab3-3da722c24794",
                        "source_sense_id": "9e73e11f-834d-3baf-ae1c-44387876836d",
                        "target_lang_word": "funnily",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "funnily",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d4249f0-f143-3b5f-b102-a20a26c9398c",
                                        "entry_id": "6bfd99d0-5b93-3e18-a630-320c2b753707",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a funny or amusing manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae15ac76-e513-45d5-a28f-007a506d4e0d",
                                                "sense_id": "1d4249f0-f143-3b5f-b102-a20a26c9398c",
                                                "text": "In this respect then, Gabriel's repetitive lyric of everyone playing: “games without frontiers and war without tears” was on the one hand quite funnily wrong. 'It's a Knockout' produced tears of laughter. […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36da7407-b709-321e-84ad-4161ad6f548f",
                                        "entry_id": "6bfd99d0-5b93-3e18-a630-320c2b753707",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a strange or unexpected manner, especially of a coincidence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea826b68-02ae-4a4f-9233-88f1d371ea10",
                                                "sense_id": "36da7407-b709-321e-84ad-4161ad6f548f",
                                                "text": "Who, Bob? I just ran into him last week, funnily enough."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cae7d012-9888-47b0-b070-4ab99c67ca78",
                                                "sense_id": "36da7407-b709-321e-84ad-4161ad6f548f",
                                                "text": "It hurts to swallow and to eat . . . sometimes, I find myself breathing funnily. The doctors have not found anything, even after the X-ray, but I feel that there is something physically wrong . . ."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0768dcfe-2404-4a7f-946e-e67982a90f85",
                        "source_entry_id": "f6d3f9c6-03b3-3bac-aab3-3da722c24794",
                        "source_sense_id": "9e73e11f-834d-3baf-ae1c-44387876836d",
                        "target_lang_word": "humorously",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "humorously",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a2ff9b4-6d3f-3137-b5ef-40259a0521cb",
                                        "entry_id": "898f4a0a-468b-31f2-a0a7-a712a17ea6e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a humorous manner; jocularly"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02875559-5582-4e19-afa5-22ecb26f34a8",
                                                "sense_id": "9a2ff9b4-6d3f-3137-b5ef-40259a0521cb",
                                                "text": "He always managed to make people laugh at the tea table - he could pull faces so humorously."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "662a604a-bbd8-428e-8a03-c0d4c511894c",
                                                "sense_id": "9a2ff9b4-6d3f-3137-b5ef-40259a0521cb",
                                                "text": "But let’s fast-forward two decades and look at a couple of interesting tokiponidos (as these descendants are humorously termed) that were both proposed in mid 2020."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
